abstract: >-
  DetWeave converts unformatted detector design discussions into evidence-linked
  geometry drafts, clarification questions, visual previews and deterministic
  GDML, Geant4 and DD4hep exports. Author: Hengne Li (李衡讷), South China Normal
  University (华南师范大学). Additional contact: Hengne.Li@cern.ch.
